    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Graphs</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Topological sort</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/alien-dictionary/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 269</a> <span class=\"chip warn\">Premium</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Alien Dictionary</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Each pair of neighbouring words gives at most one rule: the first letters where they differ. Put those rules in a graph and topologically sort it; a word before its own prefix, or a cycle, means no order exists. O(C) time for C total characters, O(1) extra space for a 26-letter alphabet.</p>\n"
